sequenceDiagram
    title Task Execution - Strategy Subscriber Lifecycle
    autonumber

    participant Runner as BacktestRunner / TradingRunner
    participant Executor as StrategyExecutor
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant EventHandler as StrategyEventHandler
    participant ResponseHandler as StrategyResponseHandler

    Runner->>Executor: open()
    Executor->>Bus: subscribe(EventHandler, StrategyEventRequest, task_id)
    Executor->>Bus: subscribe(Executor, StrategyExecutionResponse, task_id)
    Note over Bus,Executor: Subscribers only receive events for the current task
    Note over EventHandler,ResponseHandler: ResponseHandler publishes execution responses to Bus

    Runner->>Runner: execute task

    Runner->>Executor: close() in context-manager exit
    Executor->>Bus: unsubscribe(Executor response subscription)
    Executor->>Bus: unsubscribe(EventHandler)
    Note over Runner,Executor: Cleanup runs after completion, stop, pause, or failure
